{"title":"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(Cartesian_Plane)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (Cartesian Plane)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Complex_Numbers)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Complex Numbers)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Cheese)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Cheese)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution(1-16)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution(1-16)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/7/7b76f33741877a3689a474af44d81b23003db379.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-1, -2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" /> is rotated <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/5/bf5f6f71e34a8c314f0beff76bedf4e516eed1a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$270^{\\circ}$\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" /> counterclockwise about the point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/6/d261236ea904095d8d185a456444545b5206013b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3, 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />. What are the coordinates of its new position?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/4/4f4645ae6ae1e2341501887818f91259ad3cae7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ (-3, -4) \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ (0,5) \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ (2,-1) \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ (4,3) \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ (6,-3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"564\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Cartesian_Plane.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Cartesian_Plane)\">Solution 1 (Cartesian Plane)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Cartesian Plane)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/e/3ae71a5a172a28d5c8e1be19ee5133cec3eb7d47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-1,-2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> units west and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> units south of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/4/c04c2d1bd65c882efed8513bbbf77022aba66364.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3,1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />. Performing a counterclockwise rotation of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/5/bf5f6f71e34a8c314f0beff76bedf4e516eed1a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$270^{\\circ}$\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" />, which is equivalent to a clockwise rotation of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/7/6a7dfa8a2a90d521b2b03f5b82a1fb9f85dce88c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90^{\\circ}$\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" />, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> units west and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> units north of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/4/c04c2d1bd65c882efed8513bbbf77022aba66364.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3,1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/d/53d7ccc3bff570a9c5474dee373debab57e72ac0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ (0,5)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"87\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>~<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:Bxiao31415\" title=\"User:Bxiao31415\"> Bxiao31415</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Complex_Numbers.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Complex_Numbers)\">Solution 2 (Complex Numbers)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Complex Numbers)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We write <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/7/7b76f33741877a3689a474af44d81b23003db379.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-1, -2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8361b664e99544e7dafbae2f6449411ccdde069.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1-2i.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"68\" height=\"15\" /> We'd like to rotate about <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/a/a3a08cff025d545b69d06a1e31fd8e30641e4aea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3, 1),$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"47\" height=\"20\" /> which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/d/20d47d8f550b315f310118224aa0c1c5ebe758c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3+i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"37\" height=\"14\" /> in the complex plane, by an angle of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/e/efea0d8e6a8817825281299b1fe6fd64d22ef3c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$270^{\\circ} = \\frac{3\\pi}{2} \\text{ rad}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"115\" height=\"38\" /> counterclockwise.\n</p><p>The formula for rotating the complex number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> about the complex number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/e/9ee4b825a2e36ae093ed7be5e4851ef453b34914.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$w$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" /> by an angle of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/e/52e8ed7a3ba22130ad3984eb2cd413406475a689.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> counterclockwise is given as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/5/0f5729a38cb8a08361e95fef3631589fc7eea41e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(z-w)e^{\\theta i} + w.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"122\" height=\"22\" /> Plugging in our values <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/1/211719545873d9b5c22cf34f36d054b86cf2c84d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = -1-2i, w = 3+i, \\theta = \\frac{3\\pi}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"245\" height=\"38\" />, we evaluate the expression as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/1/291ab1806e14e76a9c0c95c374e9ad28e75cbe4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$((-1-2i) - (3+i))e^{\\frac{3\\pi i}{2}} + (3+i) = (-4-3i)(-i) + (3+i) = 4i-3i^2+3+i = 4i-3+3+i = 5i,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"797\" height=\"24\" /> which corresponds to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/d/53d7ccc3bff570a9c5474dee373debab57e72ac0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ (0,5)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"87\" height=\"32\" /> on the Cartesian plane.\n</p><p>~sirswagger21\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Cheese.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Cheese)\">Solution 3 (Cheese)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Cheese)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/5/bf5f6f71e34a8c314f0beff76bedf4e516eed1a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$270^{\\circ}$\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" /> rotation counterclockwise is equivalent to a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/7/6a7dfa8a2a90d521b2b03f5b82a1fb9f85dce88c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90^{\\circ}$\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" /> rotation clockwise, which means the resultant point should be around quadrant 2. Looking at the answer choices the only option that works in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/d/53d7ccc3bff570a9c5474dee373debab57e72ac0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ (0,5)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"87\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1\">Video Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/L09yN1Y5CBI\">https://youtu.be/L09yN1Y5CBI</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution.281-16.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution(1-16)\">Video Solution(1-16)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution(1-16)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/SCwQ9jUfr0g\">https://youtu.be/SCwQ9jUfr0g</a>\n</p><p>~~Hayabusa1\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B\">2022 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_15\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_18\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_20\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_22\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_23\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2022 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018011134\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.055 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 252/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2294/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 154/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5336/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.102      1 -total\n 59.23%    7.760      1 Template:AMC12_box\n 39.06%    5.118      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:23374:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018011134 and revision id 281075. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}